(The QVault contract implements a secure vault mechanism using post-quantum cryptography for authorization. It) Tj
T* (prevents traditional ECDSA key-based attacks by requiring ML-DSA-87 signatures from keys held by the chain.) Tj
T* (However, there are some potential issues related to access control and front-running vulnerabilities that need) Tj
T* (attention. The contract also includes several good practices such as proper error handling and use of domain) Tj
